	(text "In order to distinguish when we transmit or receive data, we need to \nimplement a pnp transistor. The Adafruit rest natrually at a high output.\nThe pnp combats this by having the enable signal low when the adafruit\nhas a high output. Once the Adafruit starts to trasmit data, the enable\nwill become high."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 182.372 152.654 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "e5eef66f-cdb7-4b13-b2cd-01a77b1daa32")
	)
